    "summary": "Errata to 2 Sanctus abilities:\n\n- [Creeping Shadow](vsdata:ability/genestealer-cults.sanctus.creeping-shadow): if this model has a Cult sniper rifle, then in your opponent's Movement phase, after any enemy unit finishes a move ending 8″ or less from this unit and this unit is **unengaged**, this unit may make a **Normal move** at most 6″ long.\n- [Cloaked Assassin](vsdata:ability/genestealer-cults.sanctus.cloaked-assassin): its second sentence now stops enemy units picking this unit as the target of [Snap Shooting](vsdata:core-rule/snap-shooting) attacks.",
